#: ../sphinx_source/blog/posts/2023/xarray_intro.ipynb:60002
#: 72914004214f4ac6aa6ae91ab791a3a7
msgid ""
"We now have the same data as in the array `ary` with its dimensions "
"labeled. That means we can indicate operations over specific dimensions "
"using their names instead of positional indicators. For example:"
msgstr ""

